  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy ta có\n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mo>cos</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>tan</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tVậy khẳng định ``<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>tan</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>&#x27;&#x27; là khẳng định sai.",
